": \"CAM_DEERFLOW_001\",\n        \"label\": \"person\",\n        \"start_time\": \"2026-05-20T10:00:08+08:00\",\n        \"end_time\": \"2026-05-20T10:00:10+08:00\",\n        \"duration_seconds\": 2,\n        \"last_bbox\": [\n          913.29,\n          290.3,\n          963.53,\n          361.38\n        ],\n        \"trajectory\": [\n          [\n            1046.9,\n            279.85\n          ],\n          [\n            936.85,\n            327.03\n          ],\n          [\n            938.41,\n            325.84\n          ]\n        ],\n        \"movement_state\": \"moving\",\n        \"confidence\": 0.4151,\n        \"evidence_frame_ids\": [\n          \"CAM_DEERFLOW_001_202605201000080800_0009\",\n          \"CAM_DEERFLOW_001_202605201000090800_0010\",\n          \"CAM_DEERFLOW_001_202605201000100800_0011\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"track_id\": \"track_0015\",\n        \"camera_id\": \"CAM_DEERFLOW_001\",\n        \"label\": \"person\",\n        \"start_time\": \"2026-05-20T10:00:10+08:00\",\n        \"end_time\": \"2026-05-20T10:00:10+08:00\",\n        \"duration_seconds\": 0,\n        \"last_bbox\": [\n          1036.93,\n          260.38,\n          1073.62,\n          326.35\n        ],\n        \"trajectory\": [\n          [\n            1055.28,\n            293.37\n          ]\n        ],\n        \"movement_state\": \"stationary\",\n        \"confidence\": 0.4396,\n        \"evidence_frame_ids\": [\n          \"CAM_DEERFLOW_001_202605201000100800_0011\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"read_file","id":"b12ac488-f996-402b-9486-2748fd3859fb","tool_call_id":"call_d1693365c672444cad013495","artifact":null,"status":"success"},{"content":"分析完成。根据视频对象检测与跨帧跟踪结果，在分析的这段交通视频中：\n\n## 统计结果\n\n| 类别 | 独立目标数量 |\n|------|------------|\n| **公交车** | 3 辆 |\n| **小汽车** | 10 辆 |\n| **合计车辆** | **13 辆** |\n| **行人** | **2 人** |\n\n## 分析说明\n\n- 分析时段：视频前 10 秒（每秒抽取一帧，共 11 帧）\n- 检测方法：YOLOv8n 目标检测 + 跨帧多目标跟踪（SORT）\n- 去重方式：通过轨迹关联将同一实体在不同帧中的多次识别合并为唯一 Track ID，确保不会重复计数\n\n### 跟踪详情\n\n**公交车（3 辆）**\n- track_0001：行驶中，出现于 0~9 秒，运动轨迹明显\n- track_0003：静止状态，出现于 0~4 秒\n- track_0011：仅在第 1 秒短暂出现一次\n\n**小汽车（10 辆）**\n- 多数车辆处于静止状态（疑似停放），部分有移动轨迹\n- 最长出现时长约 9 秒（track_0004、track_0005），最短仅单帧出现\n\n**行人（2 人）**\n- track_0014：出现在第 8~10 秒，处于移动状态\n- track_0015：仅在第 10 秒检测到","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":479,"prompt_tokens":31087,"total_tokens":31566,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":123,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":479},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":31087}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.6-35b-a3b","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-bf148f22-0e0e-9989-a09b-609a16f58e8f","finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019f9df7-eb92-7af3-b122-0f42a6338294-0","tool_calls":[],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":31087,"output_tokens":479,"total_tokens":31566,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":123}}}],"artifacts":[],"intent_context":{"intent":"task","original_query":"统计这段视频里出现了多少辆车、多少个行人。","normalized_query":"统计这段视频里出现了多少辆车、多少个行人。","routing_query":"场景：视频监控。场景ID：video_surveillance。场景说明：视频监控、摄像头、监控录像、视频流、实时画面、视频帧、卡口、安防巡检、目标检测、行为识别、事件发现和监控告警分析场景。需要识别参数：视频对象、监控目标、时间范围、输出形式。用户原始问题：我将统计这段视频监控画面中出现的车辆和行人数量","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","params":{"视频对象":"这段视频","监控目标":"车辆、行人"},"scene_mode":"single","scenes":["video_surveillance"],"task_spans":[{"task_span_id":"span_6664aa","text":"统计这段视频里出现了多少辆车、多少个行人。"}],"planning_steps":[{"task_span_id":"span_5f1c0e","text":"读取输入视频文件，解析时长、帧率与分辨率等基础参数，并按固定时间间隔或运动显著性抽取关键帧序列，构建用于后续分析的标准化视频样本集。"},{"task_span_id":"span_a829bb","text":"依托视频监控场景的目标检测与多目标跟踪能力，在关键帧序列中定位车辆与行人目标，记录每个实体的唯一跟踪ID，并设定置信度阈值与最小像素面积作为有效目标判定依据。"},{"task_span_id":"span_5e395d","tex